        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Toyota Hilux, Toyota Fortuner\n- Companies: Toyota\n- Projects: IMV program\n- Events: Toyota War\n- Places: South America\n\nFacts:\n- The Toyota War is primarily named after the Toyota Hilux pickup truck.\n- Toyota retired the Hilux name in South America in 1976.\n- The Toyota Hilux is part of Toyota's IMV program.\n- The Toyota Fortuner SUV is part of Toyota's IMV program with the Toyota Hilux.",
